+
+The daily snapshot date is the UTC collection date, not a historical source
+date. The default remains today UTC. Before a new or unfinished pass does any
+work, its requested date must match the UTC date of its start timestamp. A
+past or future date raises `ValueError` before any HTTP request or file write;
+the CLI exits nonzero. An old incomplete day cannot be resumed with live data.
+Already complete days, including historical days with absent newer legs,
+remain zero-call, zero-write no-ops. This admission check does not prevent a
+pass from spanning UTC midnight. The separate arXiv backfill command retains
+its retrospective namespace.
